#: ../../source/module/custom-card-development.md:1
#: 47ef1b5c54ab4e628baa81ebc9ac2ccc
msgid "自定义卡片开发"
msgstr "Develop Custom Cards"

#: ../../source/module/custom-card-development.md:3
#: fd4427cf1cd14275b856f1b1caffb722
#
msgid "本页教你为构建数据集模块开发一张新卡片，按当前的 Operation/Params 架构拆分 UI 和业务逻辑。"
msgstr ""
"This page explains how to develop a new card for the Make Dataset module "
"using the current Operation/Params architecture to separate UI and "
"business logic."

#: ../../source/module/custom-card-development.md:5
#: 5e43a649915d419a9dcbda62b54de378
msgid ""
"如果你要新增内置卡片，仓库内的 `make-dataset-card-dev` skill "
"会引导你走完整流程（规格→实现→文档→验证）。本页更适合作快速参考。"
msgstr ""
"When adding a built-in card, use the repository's `make-dataset-card-dev`"
" skill for the full specification, implementation, documentation, and "
"validation workflow. Use this page as a quick reference."

#: ../../source/module/custom-card-development.md:7
#: d101ccc21b054f8c9d1c1e2c5d588e92
msgid "架构概览"
msgstr "Architecture overview"

#: ../../source/module/custom-card-development.md:9
#: ff2e061157594fdfb7f8b6abc573a5db
msgid "每张卡片由三层组成："
msgstr "Each card has three layers:"

#: ../../source/module/custom-card-development.md:11
#: 8efb138d644d482f8aa4672afc9cf2e5
msgid ""
"CardWidget (UI)\n"
"  ├── get_params() → Params dataclass\n"
"  ├── set_params(params) → 恢复控件\n"
"  └── create_operation() → Operation\n"
"\n"
"CardOperation (纯逻辑，在 core/cards/)\n"
"  └── run_structure(structure, params) / run_dataset(dataset, params) / "
"generate(params)\n"
"\n"
"CardParams (frozen dataclass)\n"
"  └── 所有参数的类型、默认值、范围\n"
msgstr ""
"CardWidget (UI)\n"
"  ├── get_params() -> Params dataclass\n"
"  ├── set_params(params) -> restore widget state\n"
"  └── create_operation() -> Operation\n"
"\n"
"CardOperation (pure logic in core/cards/)\n"
"  └── run_structure(structure, params) / run_dataset(dataset, params) / "
"generate(params)\n"
"\n"
"CardParams (frozen dataclass)\n"
"  └── types, defaults, and ranges for every parameter\n"

#: ../../source/module/custom-card-development.md:24
#: 1a3d14eed15f49a69f222bf289cebffa
msgid "**UI 层**不写算法，只读控件、构造 params、调 operation。"
msgstr ""
"The **UI layer** contains no algorithms. It reads widgets, constructs the"
" params object, and invokes the operation."

#: ../../source/module/custom-card-development.md:25
#: 2ae0a2da79ed43e5b51ebf749f96e419
msgid ""
"**Operation 层**不 import "
"`PySide6`、`qfluentwidgets`、`MessageManager`。错误直接抛异常。"
msgstr ""
"The **Operation layer** must not import `PySide6`, `qfluentwidgets`, or "
"`MessageManager`. Report errors by raising exceptions."

#: ../../source/module/custom-card-development.md:27
#: 93fcba6219dc4174a417e744f250584d
msgid "第一步：选 Operation 类型"
msgstr "Step 1: Choose the operation type"

